Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.07,0:00:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((游马：星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能玩决斗真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.27,0:00:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算居住的世界和语言不同{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也能和任何人一起玩成为伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越是认真就越能互相理解{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.83,0:00:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心里激动不已…嘿嘿嘿。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.01,0:00:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐，星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等 No.卡全部集齐之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你打算怎么办啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.37,0:00:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光）完成使命
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回到星光世界而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊…也是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那，在那之后你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那之后？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那之后的未来我从未想过。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊真没劲啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.52,0:00:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哟！ 哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可是一直都在想啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超级闪闪发光的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}耀眼得{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.05,0:00:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让人神清气爽的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天也让你见识见识我的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的未来…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 不过 到那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你可能已经不在了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 你刚才是不是觉得我看起来很寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}觉得这家伙分别的时候会哭对吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！ 那好啊 我绝对不会哭的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}离别的时候 我要跟你来一场真正的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.67,0:01:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对要赢下来然后笑给你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这么约好了))
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《阿斯特拉尔说的约定是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.01,0:01:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马的生命值变成300了……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)而且那家伙的场地上……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(安娜)已经没有怪兽了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.59,0:01:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(权现坂)但是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.31,0:01:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔的希望之路还有……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)还有2个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.19,0:01:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:01:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.07,0:02:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量加速的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔可以再攻击一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})一旦那成真 游马就……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.99,0:02:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 刚才说过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.35,0:02:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((你要 把曾经和我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.11,0:02:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}许下的约定给我实现！))
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 是那时候的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.39,0:02:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动超量·加速的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.18,0:02:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.63,0:02:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再进行一次攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《和你分别之时的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}认真决斗中 我说过我会笑…》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧 对游马直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《在决斗中笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.21,0:02:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗明明应该是更让人兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更让人心跳加速 更快乐的东西{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.95,0:02:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知何时起 净是在哭…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 原来是失去了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发自内心地笑这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.27,0:02:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 是想让我回想起这件事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.73,0:02:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.94,0:03:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 大师决斗·抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当受到比自己生命值攻击力更高的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.78,0:03:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽一张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那张是陷阱卡的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能无效战斗并发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔 我想起来了和你的约定。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.65,0:03:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来 你这家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让我察觉到那件事……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是有多死认真多笨拙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.94,0:03:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我明白了 阿斯特拉尔 约好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会笑的赢过你 然后打从心底里笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你看看 我的未来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那道光芒 难道说…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强决斗者的决斗 全都是必然。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连抽卡 也是决斗者所创造的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 果然你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那场远古之战中分离的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.81,0:04:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毫无疑问是我的分身。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《另一个我…》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽到的是 陷阱卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 战斗无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我发动 这张陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大师之作！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.11,0:04:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这回合 因战斗被送入墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:25.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以进行超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.63,0:04:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 我我我枪手 和 我我我武士
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.19,0:04:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.38,0:04:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是 现身吧 FNo.0！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天马 如今在此解放
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纵横无尽地奔向未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的 天地开辟！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.42,0:04:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的未来！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.18,0:04:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来皇 希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级０的 No.怪兽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马全新的 No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来皇 希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得跟游马很像。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是你的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的未来还什么都没定下来呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.03,0:05:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 阶级０的可能性。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是很有你风格的 No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.10,0:05:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 这场与你最后的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.71,0:05:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}享受享受享受个痛快{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最后绝对要笑着收场！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.44,0:05:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用未来皇 霍普 攻击 霍普·莱兹！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用攻击力0的未来皇 霍普{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
