Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:05:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是打算搞什么名堂吧？ 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个嘛 谁知道呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.13,0:06:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 又是虚张声势吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 霍普·莱兹的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与怪兽进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把1个超量单位
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送给对方{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到这个回合结束
