Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.65,0:06:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为与对方怪兽的阶级差乘以100{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.37,0:06:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再乘以对方超量单位数量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.39,0:06:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的数值。
