Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.41,0:06:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗伤害也变成0{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得与它战斗的对方怪兽的控制权{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅限战斗期间。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，未来皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑 未来斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.61,0:06:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，霍普·鲁兹的控制权
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:06:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就归我了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是未来皇 霍普的力量吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，霍普·鲁兹！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对阿斯特拉尔直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得不错嘛，游马。嘿嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的攻击看来不是虚张声势啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不愧是阿斯特拉尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然把希望·根的攻击力降低了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.31,0:07:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你找到了新的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就不可能是虚张声势之类的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿！和你决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最让人兴奋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你真正的全力让我见识见识！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得这决斗变得越来越厉害了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方都一步不让。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.54,0:07:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过游马和星光总觉得很开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，阶级０若有无穷的可能性{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.21,0:08:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就要更进一步，向上走！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的光啊，力量啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.57,0:08:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄宿于我的右臂照亮希望之路吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.61,0:08:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 超量升级魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究极之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶为阶级10的 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.41,0:08:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡作为超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶 超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.99！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}碎裂散落吧 我灵魂的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如今 化作一颗星辰成为贯穿天命的霹雳！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 No.的终焉与顶点！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.97,0:08:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇龙 霍普德拉古恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:08:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是阶级10 No.99{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.22,0:09:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇龙 霍普德拉古恩。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动霍普德拉古恩的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次将墓地中的1只 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效其效果并特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 No.39{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 彼岸·霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 连彼岸都…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 在未来皇 霍普的效果面前…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.89,0:09:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 希望龙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击未来皇 霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.27,0:09:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再次发动未来皇 霍普的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗不会被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗伤害也变成0{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.98,0:09:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 获得与它战斗的怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.60,0:09:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}控制权。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没那么容易！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 希望龙的进一步效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.59,0:09:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当这只怪兽离开自己场上的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.90,0:09:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.27,0:09:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除了希望皇龙以外的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咳！ 想得美！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来皇 希望的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.71,0:10:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让这张卡的破坏无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来未来皇 希望就不会被破坏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的目标 可不是那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.37,0:10:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的是 彼岸·霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 根据被破坏怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害会打到你身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})被破坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.11,0:10:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼岸·霍普的攻击力是3000！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马要是吃了这一击的话！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行——！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 我发动未来皇 霍普的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一个效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去除一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将我受到的效果伤害无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样回合结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真有你的 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.07,0:11:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能就因为这个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就结束和你的最棒决斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.21,0:11:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得 好羡慕啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.81,0:11:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.91,0:11:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打从心底享受决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！ 根本不需要什么语言！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.93,0:11:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.61,0:11:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼此心灵相互碰撞互相倾诉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是般配的两人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.66,0:11:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咔嚓)两人都闪闪发光喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.76,0:11:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《恐怕 这是最后的回合了。我…》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:11:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.07,0:12:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.10,0:12:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光… 我的全力接住试试看吧！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！ 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.27,0:12:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 未来皇 霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击 霍普龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你怪兽的控制权 我收下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的！ 霍普龙的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将离开自己场上的效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.61,0:12:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏未来皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动未来皇 霍普的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用叠放单位将破坏无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！胜负才刚刚开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.51,0:12:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！反击挑战！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.01,0:12:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己回合的战斗中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:12:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将攻击过的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:12:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量素材的效果无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再次进行攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.21,0:13:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是把霍普的效果无效了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会被战斗破坏掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，我发动陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}勇敢记忆！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽之间进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方墓地每存在1只 No.怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}500点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加在参与战斗的未来皇 霍普的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 攻击力是4000！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！ 希望皇 再加上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马和鲨鱼的 No.们！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 攻击力和 希望龙一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算同归于尽吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.37,0:13:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明亮记忆的 更进一步效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的怪兽 这个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 破坏对方怪兽后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没能造成伤害的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.78,0:13:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再进行一次 战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光如果下一次攻击确定的话 我就…》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用未来皇希望皇 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.21,0:14:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 命运之门 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运之门！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.10,0:14:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这… 这里是。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 命运之门。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.72,0:14:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将直接攻击无效
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且下个回合从墓地除外「No.」怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每除外1张
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.21,0:14:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对手500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}若不破坏这扇门，就是你输了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.63,0:15:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这扇门……与你相遇了……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们就是从这里开始的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，我在这里与那扇门。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((开启此门者将获得新的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，那个人作为代价
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将会失去最重要的东西))
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界……没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我来说最重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是，除了你以外别无他人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我……对你……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要害怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你手中剩下的那一张是什么 我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.13,0:15:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用那只手去开辟吧 未来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要害怕未来 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral 难道你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了给我离别的勇气。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:16:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你竟然向我挑战决斗还早了100年！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.57,0:16:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 双重提升机会发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当怪兽的攻击被无效时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变成2倍再攻击一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 未来皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.83,0:16:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是真正的最后一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 Astral！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《Astral 我不会忘记。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起战斗 一起哭一起笑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.18,0:16:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵过架也和好过{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论何时 无论何时我的身边都有你在。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 从今往后…》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:16:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:17:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要开辟未来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望之剑 未来斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.89,0:17:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.39,0:17:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.代码。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:18:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来离别的时候到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.06,0:18:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道 我绝对不会哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我最喜欢你的笑容了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.31,0:18:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望你不要忘记 那份笑容。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要忘记热血沸腾。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.71,0:18:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}猛然燃起！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.16,0:18:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是鼓起勇气迈出一步！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是无论身处怎样的危机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.37,0:18:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也绝不放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是向一切困难发起挑战！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.11,0:18:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会忘
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.61,0:18:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不会忘！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.60,0:18:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也绝不会忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:18:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.71,0:19:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.84,0:19:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了 糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.40,0:19:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟到了 迟到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.61,0:19:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我先走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.19,0:19:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜就这样 我的战斗结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.35,0:19:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}日常生活又回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是，和以往稍微不同的是…＞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)很遗憾，出局了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.11,0:19:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为惩罚，就罚你打扫厕所一周吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}芋鲨～ 那里就通融一下嘛…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，决定改成两周。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜ 对了，阿斯特拉尔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.97,0:19:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是用 No.代码的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后把七皇作为人类送回了这个世界＞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(鲨鱼)那家伙还是老样子啊，那个笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.68,0:20:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜ 不止这些。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去了阿斯特拉尔世界的我爸。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有我妈也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.89,0:20:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然，海斗和欧比塔尔也回来了…＞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)欧比塔尔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.97,0:20:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马上解析这份数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.37,0:20:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(３人)遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(隼人)遵命，大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜现在 和特隆他们一起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重新开始了异世界的研究。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.96,0:20:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 和大家一起热热闹闹地决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.59,0:20:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样 一如往常的生活回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.70,0:20:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唯独有一件事就是那家伙不在了…＞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜ 一切 都一如往常…＞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.98,0:20:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:20:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:20:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(鲨鱼)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.93,0:21:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(鲨鱼)你们要垂头丧气到什么时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.18,0:21:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去星光世界新的危机正在逼近。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.68,0:21:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!? 星光界？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾娜)那片土地上混沌之力正在集结。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.75,0:21:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾利法斯)由于 No.代码的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.12,0:21:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界与巴利安世界合为一体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接纳了混沌。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾娜)但是 那也意味着新的战斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要去吗？ 星光界。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.03,0:21:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.94,0:21:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等 等等 等一下游马 等等我！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.07,0:21:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙欠我很大的人情。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是我们齐心协力的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前往异世界的准备已经做好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.14,0:21:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干劲十足 海斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.87,0:21:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)现在正是我们行动之时。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.02,0:22:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})就让本大爷好好给你点粉丝福利
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.33,0:22:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和游马一起无论到哪我都会战斗下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.74,0:22:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多隆)将我们家族羁绊之力解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(杜尔贝)复苏的我们七皇之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.43,0:22:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就为星光体而用吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.64,0:22:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)真正龙使者的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你好好尝尝！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.18,0:22:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)嘿嘿 那就大干一场吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来了！ 喔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.26,0:22:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)哦好久没大闹一场了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.67,0:22:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.60,0:22:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)锵锵锵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.71,0:22:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本大爷好心好意也来帮你们一把。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.78,0:22:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.53,0:22:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀 贝库塔这次要乖乖待着哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.33,0:22:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁知道呢。不过跟你们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大闹一场也不赖。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.99,0:22:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.76,0:22:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下全员都到齐了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.62,0:22:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论是谁心中都有善与恶在交战。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.55,0:22:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但只要不从中逃避{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.43,0:22:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能和任何人互相理解。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:23:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，我会继续战斗下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.67,0:23:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到所有人都能互相理解的那一天到来。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.44,0:23:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.24,0:23:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也最喜欢游马的那份笑容！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，要去夺回来对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.86,0:23:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那最重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.37,0:23:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.59,0:23:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的 热血沸腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.09,0:23:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.20,0:23:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.19,0:23:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.95,0:23:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.24,0:23:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
